sequenceDiagram
 participant S as Sender
 participant R as Receiver
 participant D as Disk
 participant DB as SQLite
 S->>S: Hash source then rewind
 S->>R: put(id,name,size,sha256)
 R->>S: ready
 loop 64 KiB chunks
 S->>R: binary chunk
 R->>D: write temporary file
 end
 S->>R: end
 R->>R: Check size and SHA-256
 R->>D: sync, close, unique rename
 R->>DB: Record verified transfer
 R->>S: complete(id,size,sha256)
